            <ipxact:description>&lt;b&gt;Applies to 25G/10G ONLY.  BitSlip Count&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Status register to provide info to correlate DL_Pulse to aligned data.  &lt;/p&gt;</ipxact:description>
